    "Candidate target words for review-clip generation, as explicit surface-form families.",
    "WHY explicit forms and not a stemmer: the 2026-07-31 audit found the shared-stem prefix",
    "heuristic had BOTH live false negatives (stem-changing verbs: encontrar -> encuentra) and",
    "a false-positive class it introduced itself (director -> directamente). An exhaustive",
    "per-word form list has neither. Same mechanism as FORMS in check_alignment_v2.py.",
