    "'sense' documents the reading we are targeting. 'block' lists collocations where the word",
    "appears in a DIFFERENT sense and the occurrence must be skipped -- this is the 'mesa'",
    "failure mode (mesa de trabajo is a committee, not a table) generalized.",
    "",
    "Selection rationale is in phase2/WORD_SELECTION.md. Reviewer verdicts, not this file,",
    "are ground truth: a wrong guess here costs review time, never a wrong label."
